    "travel_coverage": false,
    "fully_funded": false,
    "funding_label": "Cash quota of an unpublished amount, free university canteen for winners and eligible non-winners, free DSU residence place for winners (EUR 262.50 per month for eligible non-winners) and exemption from the regional right-to-study fee. Tuition, travel and living costs beyond the quota are not covered, so the award is need-based support rather than a fully funded package.",
