      "Hold a DSU valid for facilitated right-to-study services, relating to the applicant student, subscribed by 7 September 2026",
      "Be enrolled, or enrol, for the first degree on a laurea course of a Tuscan institution",
      "Not already hold an academic title of the same level as the course applied for",
      "Meet the ISEE and ISPE economic requirements set by the call",
      "Meet the merit requirements set by the call (art. 5.3)",
      "Declare an Italian or SEPA-area IBAN of an account or prepaid card in the student's own name for payment"
    ],
    "documents": [
